<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Delta Electronics Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Delta Electronics Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997		     1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     6.10	 vs	  3.39</p>
<p>    Net		    366.21	 vs	203.29</p>
<p>					  Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     11.02	vs	   6.57</p>
<p>    Net		     660.99	vs	 394.33</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is Delta Electronics Plc, an electronics component manufacturer.</p>
